WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:02.600 --> 00:00:06.299
I hope you'll join us here at Kaiapoi's Trousselot Park for the annual district

00:00:06.299 --> 00:00:11.160
Waitangi Day celebrations. This whole
area will be jam-packed full of stalls

00:00:11.160 --> 00:00:13.980
and there will be something to see, do
and eat for every member of the family

00:00:13.980 --> 00:00:16.180
with free entertainment all day long.

00:00:17.680 --> 00:00:20.040
All that and more for the Waitangi Day

00:00:20.040 --> 00:00:24.280
celebrations here at the Kaiapoi's Trousselot Park between 10 and 2 o'clock

